@* The strength bar and the four rules, ticked off as the person types (wwwroot/js/password-ui.js). The server enforces the same rules. *@
<div class="meter-pw" aria-hidden="true" data-pw-meter><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
<div class="rules" data-pw-rules>
    <span data-rule="len"><i>@Ui.Icon("check", 11, 3.2)</i> At least 8 characters</span>
    <span data-rule="upper"><i>@Ui.Icon("check", 11, 3.2)</i> An upper-case letter</span>
    <span data-rule="digit"><i>@Ui.Icon("check", 11, 3.2)</i> A number</span>
    <span data-rule="symbol"><i>@Ui.Icon("check", 11, 3.2)</i> A symbol, such as ! or #</span>
</div>
